unt":13,"description":"\u003cp\u003eHi, I'm starting a small side project to learn web development and have fun. Could you suggest a good CSS Framework for it? My candidates are: \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/picnicss/picnic\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehttps://github.com/picnicss/picnic\u003c/a\u003e (it seems the most simple) \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/jgthms/bulma/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehttps://github.com/jgthms/bulma/\u003c/a\u003e (very easy, but very minimal) \u003ca href=\"https://milligram.github.io/\" rel=\"ugc\"\u003ehttps://milligram.github.io/\u003c/a\u003e (more complete)\nFot javascript I want to use Vue.js because it's easy, clean and I can control it. Using Flask (Python) for backend.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"Hi, I'm starting a small side project to learn web development and have fun. Could you suggest a good CSS Framework for it? My candidates are: https://github.com/picnicss/picnic (it seems the most simple) https://github.com/jgthms/bulma/ (very easy, but very minimal) https://milligram.github.io/ (more complete)\r\nFot javascript I want to use Vue.js because it's easy, clean and I can control it. Using Flask (Python) for backend.","submitter_user":"lormayna","user_is_author":true,"tags":["ask"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/mjkl3a","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/mjkl3a/best_minimal_css_framework_for_side"},{"short_id":"zitiho","created_at":"2016-02-17T10:40:20.000-06:00","title":"Stack Overflow: The Architecture - 2016 Edition","url":"http://nickcraver.com/blog/2016/02/17/stack-overflow-the-architecture-2016-edition/","score":7,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"pushcx","user_is_author":false,"tags":["devops"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/zitiho","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/zitiho/stack_overflow_architecture_2016"},{"short_id":"x7sqe0","created_at":"2016-02-17T10:27:00.000-06:00","title":"The Computer Chronicles: Unix (1989)","url":"https://archive.org/details