","url":"https://www.eff.org/deeplinks/2016/02/federal-circuit-sticks-its-guns-patent-owners-can-prevent-you-owning-anything","score":3,"flags":0,"comment_count":1,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"halosghost","user_is_author":false,"tags":["law"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/8hgc4i","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/8hgc4i/federal_circuit_sticks_its_guns_patent"},{"short_id":"vken4t","created_at":"2016-02-16T19:12:59.000-06:00","title":"C◦mp◦se :: Conference 2015 Videos","url":"http://www.composeconference.org/2015/summary/","score":6,"flags":0,"comment_count":2,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"tf","user_is_author":false,"tags":["dotnet","haskell","ml","video"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/vken4t","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/vken4t/c_mp_se_conference_2015_videos"},{"short_id":"yicgr5","created_at":"2016-02-16T19:04:48.000-06:00","title":"ZenHub.io","url":"https://www.zenhub.io/","score":5,"flags":1,"comment_count":3,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"geier","user_is_author":false,"tags":["programming"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/yicgr5","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/yicgr5/zenhub_io"},{"short_id":"zrfzwp","created_at":"2016-02-16T16:33:22.000-06:00","title":"Bookiza - A book reification framework","url":"http://bookiza.io/","score":27,"flags":0,"comment_count":5,"description":"\u003cp\u003eHello lobsters!,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt's time to show a little \u003ccode\u003ejavascript framework\u003c/code\u003e (I know, yet another!) that I have been working on. Except, this one isn't meant to create apps. It does books instead.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBookiza is a book reification framework with which you can bake books, comics or magazines and publish 'em online. In less than half the time we otherwise used to.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI hope you'll like it. Good or bad, all thoughts are very welcome.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e:)\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"Hello lobsters!,\r\n\r\nIt's time to show a little `javascript framework` (I know, yet another!) that I have been working on. Except, this one isn't meant to create apps. It does books instead. \r\n\r\nBookiza is a book reification framework with which you can bake books, comics or magazines and publish 'em online. In less than half the time we otherwise used to. \r\n\r\nI hope you'll like it. Good or bad, all thoughts are very welcome. \r\n\r\n:)","submitter_user":"marvindanig","user_is_author":true,"tags":["show"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/zrfzwp","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/zrfzwp/bookiza_book_reification_framework"}]